{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是正證法界盤出真陁摩\n尼寶依證珠出阿含光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此有為法界中教門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "肝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "脾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "腎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "肺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此唯有相法界門中位也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以十八錢轉變成輪字諸\n經所說無住義准以可知\n又十八具者即輪義"}
{"id": null, "n": "0628b1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0628b1401", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【房山】"}
